      "writtenOn": "2021-08-20T10:47:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is a huge problem with marking these properties as required. The \u0027required\u0027 field means that they are required to be defined in device tree file explicitly.\nThis means that even if field has default value in specific battery binding file, it has to be defined again in dts. And this field cannot be overwritten in specific battery to not be required. This discards whole sense of bindings for specific batteries.",
      "parentUuid": "e389c57c_1fe89d90",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 14,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 36,
        "endChar": 0
      },
