      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does it make sense to put all the battery enums here?\nMy concern is someone adding a new battery.yaml via copy/paste and the enum isn\u0027t updated. A board could then add two different batteries that have the same enum.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 12,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 12,
