      "message": "I was wondering about that. It may be a good idea, the only question I have is if we want to force people to list all batteries in one file. It may be rare, but if 2 batteries will be added (in different commits), it will raise conflict in file. If it isn\u0027t a problem, then it is a good idea to list all enums.",
